                                "sense_id": "0f9cccf7-0aad-3690-b563-5078ef294065",
                                "text": "When frustrated tacklers finally do catch up with him, Arnett knows how to take his lumps. \"If I hit the ground tensely, rigidly, and two tons of angry linemen landed on top of me, they'd break every bone in my body.\""
